  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;intersect the plane containing the lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;at the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math>&nbsp;equals ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given plane contain line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So equation of plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;will satisfy&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now normal vector of the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and direction ratio along the line which contained the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Since they will be perpendicular,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on solving equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we&nbsp;get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, now equation of plane will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now let the point in the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;satisfy the equation of plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
